  "description": "Given an integer n, return the number of structurally unique BSTs that store nodes 1 to n.",
  "target": 3,
  "pseudocode": "function numTrees(n) {\n  let G = new Array(n + 1).fill(0);\n  G[0] = 1; G[1] = 1;\n  for (let i = 2; i <= n; i++) {\n    for (let j = 1; j <= i; j++) {\n      G[i] += G[j - 1] * G[i - j];\n    }\n  }\n  return G[n];\n}",
